<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill on America West.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill on America West.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named America West Holdings Corp is Focus One stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- Said it raised its near-term rating on the stock to buy from accumulate, keeping it as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/4 to 16-1/2.</p>
</text>
